    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2099.</strong> You are the head of Meaning Intelligence in the  last city on Earth. Find a way out of the crisis in which the city finds itself. Only you decide whether it will have a future. The city has reached outstanding technological heights, but its inhabitants have lost the meaning. Should you try to save the city or let it perish? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to the Valley of Mists</strong> - a mysterious dreamlands space beyond space and time. Study the dreams of the key citizens and influence their fate through the mystical monoliths located in the Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A small 3D first-person adventure game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A meditative, thoughtful journey without violence, monsters or jump scares. Leave the hectic world for a while and return to yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Atmosphere inspired by the works of David Lynch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievements related to the search for secret knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Picturesque valley created on Unreal Engine 5.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2099.</strong> You are the head of Meaning Intelligence in the  last city on Earth. Find a way out of the crisis in which the city finds itself. Only you decide whether it will have a future. The city has reached outstanding technological heights, but its inhabitants have lost the meaning. Should you try to save the city or let it perish? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to the Valley of Mists</strong> - a mysterious dreamlands space beyond space and time. Study the dreams of the key citizens and influence their fate through the mystical monoliths located in the Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A small 3D first-person adventure game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A meditative, thoughtful journey without violence, monsters or jump scares. Leave the hectic world for a while and return to yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Atmosphere inspired by the works of David Lynch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievements related to the search for secret knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Picturesque valley created on Unreal Engine 5.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the Valley of Mists, where lucid dreams create reality. Study people's dreams and determine their fate. Leave the hectic world for a while and return to yourself.",
